  "notes": "Same ReedPop platform/template as New York Comic Con. No og:image on this page; hero images were either last year's May-edition hotel banner or single-guest headshots, so the cover falls back to the dated 'MCM London Fall' logo (the October-season mark, vs. a separate May logo also present). The 'Natural Six' live-show cast (Aoife Wilson, Chris Trott, Hollie Bennett, Katie Morrison, Kim Richards, Mara Holmes, Rhi Frost, Tom Hazell) have no named credit on their cards, so cat is 'other' rather than guessed; Ben Starr, Doug Cockle and Harry McEntire are also in that cast but do list a specific game/show credit so are filed as voice. Rick Riordan, V.E. Schwab and Veronica Roth show only 'TBD'/'Writers Block' on this card with no credit text; their author cat is corroborated from their own cards on the New York Comic Con page (same research session), not guessed from this card alone."
